(
    title: "Armor Ambush",
    developer: Some("Hal Finney"),
    description: Some("A two-player tank duel, ported from Mattel\'s Intellivision game Armor Battle. Each player commands a pair of tanks — switching between the two on command — and fights across a fresh, randomly generated battlefield every round, where forest, water and natural barriers slow or block movement. Pulling down while firing lays a mine that stays live for the rest of the battle and destroys any tank that rolls over it. There is no computer opponent, so it takes two players."),
